{"about_the_game":"Are you one of those ROUND-EARTHERS? Do you think the sun isn't hung from a bale of twine cast down from the star-heavens? Well then, don't bother trying this couch-multiplaying, trident-hurling, death-o-gasm of an aquatic mammal simulation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.poster.avif?t=1582817559\" width=588 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.webm?t=1582817559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.mp4?t=1582817559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br><strong>JUST DON'T BOTHER!</strong><br><strong>IT'S NOT FOR YOU.</strong> Go back to your schooools and your interwebs, sheeple.<br><br><i>Still here? Then you're in the club. We meet every Thursday under the wilted elm behind the ghost of the old Windsor Castle in Boise Idaho. Bring torches, skepticism, and a preparedness for mind destroying truth. Also BYOB.</i><br><br><strong>STAY WOKE!</strong><br><br><i>As for features, it's more like, what's NOT in this game! Am I right!?</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-4 Players local death-match insanity with AI opponents to fill out the roster<br></li><li>Multiple movement, scoring, and collision modes which can be randomized to increase the insanity<br></li><li>Multiple rendering modes which can be stacked to further increase the insanity<br></li><li>Toggleable 'goodies' to increase things like player speed, opponents' size, and general insanity<br></li><li>A general thumb in the eye of science and rational thought</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/fcfae0c5368bb2a2f784843131d964a5.avif?t=1582817559\" width=590 height=592 /></span>.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1121860?t=1582817559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1121860?t=1582817559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1582817559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1582817559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Are you one of those ROUND-EARTHERS? Do you think the sun isn't hung from a bale of twine cast down from the star-heavens? Well then, don't bother trying this couch-multiplaying, trident-hurling, death-o-gasm of an aquatic mammal simulation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.poster.avif?t=1582817559\" width=588 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.webm?t=1582817559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121860/extras/308ee2aba99d83c79b76bcbe07fcad54.mp4?t=1582817559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br><strong>JUST DON'T BOTHER!</strong><br><strong>IT'S NOT FOR YOU.</strong> Go back to your schooools and your interwebs, sheeple.<br><br>